## What This Means for You

If you run any of the affected products, **patch immediately**. Every vulnerability in this roundup is in CISA's KEV catalog, which lists only flaws with confirmed exploitation in the wild.

Use the [CVSS Calculator](/cvss-calculator.html) to assess how these scores apply to your specific environment.

